## To produce a real Nougat/Marker MMD later
```bash
# uicgpu path (GPU A100)
ssh uicgpu 'cd ~/marker && python -m marker.convert_single \
  /path/to/paper.pdf \
  --output_dir /path/to/output'

# or Nougat
ssh uicgpu 'nougat /path/to/paper.pdf -o /path/to/output --model 0.1.0-base'
```
Then overwrite this stub with the Marker/Nougat output and re-verify the numeric
extraction against `data/repass/paper_layout.txt`.
